{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213520","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213520","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1521352001:0":{"text":"くたばれ、ホーリン！うちの娘をそそのかして駆け落ちとは、いい度胸だ！","source_cn":"该死的呼临人！你竟敢蛊惑芙跟你私奔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0147190D6A83A6F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521352002:0":{"text":"駆け落ち？違います……ぼ、僕はただ！","source_cn":"私奔……？我、我没有啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC67C34161AB5906C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521352003:0":{"text":"お父さん、マルコさんはそんなことしないわ！","source_cn":"阿爹，马尔科没做那样的事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885F049DE1D48BC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521352004:0":{"text":"か……彼を傷つけるつもりならお父さんでも許さない！私たちは愛し合ってるの！","source_cn":"我……我不许你伤害他！我和他是真心相爱的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282D21DC9701CA21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521352005:0":{"text":"フルア、どけ！","source_cn":"芙，你让开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6160589139A5F3D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521352006:1":{"te